# drive.press with text overrides (tools/port/mods_synth.py's text set: every English [single] string 24 letters long):
# the game reads the bank the mod's text/en.txt made, and the race's HUD text, drawn in black, grows (drive's 491 black
# pixels; docs/port/MODS.md 8).
# until: 0x400000:900
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --mods-dir mods/text --screenshot-at 1600 --screenshot mods_text.png
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py log mods_text.game.log --has "mods: 1 on: Long text 1.0 (0 files, text)" --has "1 of the cartridge's files replaced"
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py shot mods_text.png --rgb 0,0,0 --min 900
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 20        # gas for 20 s
32 STICKRIGHT 1.5
36 STICKLEFT 1.5
47 B 3         # the brake
